          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is it time to rename the program \"text2cap\", as it writes arbitrary capture file types, not just pcap files?\n\n(Yes, \"pcap\" refers to a particular type of capture file, as originally defined by the authors of tcpdump and libpcap.  Please inform the media.)",
